StrategyKeeperExecutor::checkUpkeep()
├── Given the executor is paused
│   └── It should return false
├── Given the Controller or StrategyManager is paused
│   └── It should return false
├── Given a registered strategy is unhealthy and not paused
│   └── It should return true with Rebalance
├── Given pending redemptions exceed the Controller balance by at least minWithdrawETH
│   ├── When strategies have withdrawable funds
│   │   └── It should return true with WithdrawShortfall
│   └── When nothing is withdrawable
│       └── It should skip the withdrawal action
├── Given the AMM free balance is below exitLiquidityTargetETH (target > 0)
│   ├── When the idle Controller excess covers at least minExitLiquidityTopUpETH of top-up
│   │   └── It should return true with ProvideExitLiquidity
│   └── When the available top-up is below minExitLiquidityTopUpETH
│       └── It should skip the exit-liquidity action
├── Given the AMM float is at target or exitLiquidityTargetETH is zero (default)
│   └── It should never return ProvideExitLiquidity
├── Given the Controller holds excess ETH above reserve and pending needs
│   ├── When the excess is at least minDepositETH and a healthy strategy has capacity
│   │   └── It should return true with DepositExcess
│   ├── When every strategy is cooling down after a withdrawal (strategyDepositCooldown > 0)
│   │   └── It should skip the deposit action (lower-priority actions stay selectable)
│   └── When no strategy has capacity
│       └── It should skip the deposit action
├── Given accrued performance fees meet minHarvestETH
│   └── It should return true with HarvestPerformanceFees
├── Given accrued fees are below minHarvestETH or performanceFeeBps is zero
│   └── It should skip the harvest action
├── Given syncInterval elapsed since the last sync and strategies are registered
│   └── It should return true with Sync
├── Given syncInterval is zero
│   └── It should never return Sync
└── Given no action is needed
    └── It should return false

StrategyKeeperExecutor::performUpkeep()
├── When the caller is not the registered Forwarder
│   └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorOnlyForwarder
├── Given the executor is paused
│   └── It should revert with EnforcedPause
├── When performData encodes Rebalance
│   ├── When all strategies are healthy or paused
│   │   └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorNoUpkeepNeeded
│   └── When a strategy is unhealthy and not paused
│       ├── It should call Controller.checkAndRebalanceStrategies
│       └── It should emit StrategyUpkeepPerformed
├── When performData encodes WithdrawShortfall
│   ├── When there is no shortfall above minWithdrawETH
│   │   └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorNoUpkeepNeeded
│   └── When a shortfall exists
│       ├── It should withdraw the recomputed shortfall to the Controller
│       └── It should emit StrategyUpkeepPerformed
├── When performData encodes ProvideExitLiquidity
│   ├── When the float is at target, the target is zero, or the top-up is below minExitLiquidityTopUpETH
│   │   └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorNoUpkeepNeeded
│   └── When the float is below target and idle excess exists
│       ├── It should call Controller.provideExitLiquidity with the recomputed top-up (capped at the excess)
│       └── It should emit StrategyUpkeepPerformed
├── When performData encodes DepositExcess
│   ├── When the excess is below minDepositETH or no strategy has capacity (e.g. all in deposit cooldown)
│   │   └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorNoUpkeepNeeded
│   └── When excess exists and a strategy has capacity
│       ├── It should deposit the recomputed excess into strategies
│       └── It should emit StrategyUpkeepPerformed
├── When performData encodes HarvestPerformanceFees
│   ├── When pending fees are below minHarvestETH
│   │   └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorNoUpkeepNeeded
│   └── When pending fees meet minHarvestETH
│       ├── It should call Controller.harvestPerformanceFeeFromStrategies
│       └── It should emit StrategyUpkeepPerformed with the view-estimated feeETH
├── When performData encodes Sync
│   ├── When the interval has not elapsed or sync is disabled
│   │   └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorNoUpkeepNeeded
│   └── When the interval elapsed
│       ├── It should call Controller.syncStrategies
│       ├── It should update lastSyncAt
│       └── It should emit StrategyUpkeepPerformed
└── When performData encodes an unknown action
    └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorUnknownAction

StrategyKeeperExecutor::setters()
├── When the caller lacks ADMIN_ROLE
│   └── It should revert with RegistryClientMissingRole
├── When setMinDepositETH is called with zero
│   └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorInvalidConfig
├── When setMinHarvestETH is called with zero
│   └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorInvalidConfig
├── When setMinExitLiquidityTopUpETH is called with zero
│   └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorInvalidConfig
└── When the caller has ADMIN_ROLE and the value is valid
    ├── It should update the configuration value
    └── It should emit the corresponding Changed event
